    "\n",
    "This course is designed for learners with a basic understanding of statistics and Python programming. It is intended to provide a practical introduction to business forecasting, focusing on the application of statistical and machine learning techniques to real-world business problems.\n",
    "  \n",
    "This course is not intended for learners seeking advanced software development or software engineering concepts.\n",
